# Nothing is built or installed here - the pack has no dependencies.
# These are only guards against local noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
build-output/

# The pack's own build notes stay local. This repo is the starter itself, and
# these are a working diary of building it: a chronological record naming real
# projects, live hosts and a domain. `dev-notes/decisions.md` is tracked - it
# explains why the pack is shaped this way and names nothing personal.
dev-notes/status.md
dev-notes/coverage.md
